Current NAC Capabilities

- Create Profiles of all connected devices, NAC then permits access to network resources based on the device profile.
  If a device doesn't have a defined profile or a profile that matches a particular function
- NAC can be integrated into the security framework, so that when a breach is detected, NAC automatically responds to notify the security operations center (SOC)
  and coordinates with other security devices to neutralize the threat. It also generate reports and insights in attemped access across the organization.
- NAC is important and helps an organization through the following:
    - oversight of all devices in use across the organization
    - cost savings
    - automation
    - enhanced IT experiences
    - ease of control


